  <p class="lede">
    Office clearance is what happens when an office is closing, moving, or significantly downsizing — the whole IT footprint needs to be dealt with in a compressed window, often against a lease deadline. This page covers how full office clearance is planned, what documentation typical clearances need (tax, dissolution, insurance, lease return), and how to compress the workflow when deadlines are tight.
  </p>

